NBO 7.0 program output for water (the NBO block only), extracted from
an ORCA-driven NBO 7.0 run. The NBO program prints the same sections
when driven by a Gaussian 16 linked with NBO 7, which is what this
fixture stands in for. The license ID was removed from the banner.

Now starting NBO....

